      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agree 🗿\n\nOne of the popular monetization strategy is to let ppl pay any arbitrary number of credits as they wish and also put top donators onto public table with their total and/or per month denotations, and maybe giving them some small benefits.\n\nI believe that's one of the best forms both for creator and end user.\n\nAnd it does not enforce end users to stay subscribed/interested on the creation. I personally know that feeling \"I'd like to support that, but one mor subscription - naaah\" on other platforms.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
